      "created_at": "2015-06-08T01:19:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The attack -1 token would be used with Baron Blade's next attack made on his turn. &nbsp;if you happen to gain an attack + 1 before Blade's next attack they will cancel each other out. &nbsp;</p>",
