      "created_at": "2015-06-08T02:41:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Kinetic redistributor does not have Blade roll dice, so it wouldn't use a -1 token. &nbsp;Operative's Bitter Spiral would use a -1, because she makes an attack.</p>",
